OL,3,GNEWSAWarning as M5 to partially close
OL,4,Afor weeks
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers have been warned to expect
OL,7,Fweeks of disruption as a motorway
OL,8,Fpartially closes amid construction of
OL,9,FBritain's biggest electric battery
OL,10,Fmanufacturing site.
OL,12,FSections of the M5 near Bridgwater are
OL,13,Fset to shut during various days and
OL,14,Fnights throughout October to allow
OL,15,Fworkers to lay new cables for the
OL,16,Fplant's energy supply.
OL,18,FClosures will begin on Monday as
OL,19,Fdeveloper Agratas starts digging
OL,20,Ftrenches along the route. The work is
OL,21,Fscheduled to take 15 days to complete.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
