OL,3,GNEWSAWarning as M5 to partially close
OL,4,Afor weeks
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Agratas spokesperson said: "We
OL,7,Frecognise the temporary disruption
OL,8,Fthese works will cause and thank
OL,9,Fmotorists and local communities for
OL,10,Ftheir patience."
